 nvolvement\, and learning more about the many programs\, services\, and r
 esources available through the LGBTQ+ Culture Center.          Whether yo
 u're new to campus or returning for another year\, this is a great opport
 unity to meet fellow students\, connect with staff\, and enjoy a warm Hoo
 sier welcome as we celebrate the start of Fall 2026 together.    All Indi
 ana University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, an
 d historical observances welcome all members of the Indiana University co
 mmunity.
