SUMMARY:LGBTQ History Trivia Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for LGBTQ+ History Trivia Night and celebrate the peo
 ple\, movements\, and moments that have shaped queer communities across g
 enerations. Test your knowledge\, learn fascinating stories\, and discove
 r how creativity\, resilience\, and a little bit of audacity have helped 
 pave the way toward liberation. No expertise required—just bring your c
 uriosity and community spirit!All Indiana University events\, groups\, ac
 tivities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome al
 l members of the Indiana University community.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div>  Join us for LGBTQ+ History Trivia Nig
 ht and celebrate the people\, movements\, and moments that have shaped qu
 eer communities across generations. Test your knowledge\, learn fascinati
 ng stories\, and discover how creativity\, resilience\, and a little bit 
 of audacity have helped pave the way toward liberation. No expertise requ
 ired—just bring your curiosity and community spirit!</div><div></div><d
 iv><strong>All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educatio
 nal\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all members of the In
 diana University community.</strong></div>
