 ng affirming fitness habits\, and building confidence in recreation space
 s. Whether you're new to working out or looking for a more inclusive appr
 oach to fitness\, this session is for you.All Indiana University events\,
  groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observance
 s welcome all members of the Indiana University community.
